Creates a new assumption instance for a <code>long</code> value. When the assumption is met, the test will execute normally and all remaining test code will run successfully. When the assumption is not met, the test is skipped and none of the remaining test code will be executed.

Executed test:

<pre><code class='java'>{@literal @Test}
public void given_the_assumption_is_met_the_test_is_executed() {
  given(1L).isOne();
  // the remaining code is executed
}</code></pre>

Skipped test:

<pre><code class='java'>{@literal @Test}
public void given_the_assumption_is_not_met_the_test_is_skipped() {
  given(1L).isZero();
  // the remaining code is NOT executed.
}</code></pre>
